<div class="sim-controls">
  <button type="button" class="btn" data-act="play" aria-pressed="false">Play</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-quiet" data-act="step">Step</button>
  <button type="button" class="btn btn-quiet" data-act="restart">Restart</button>
  <label class="sim-speed">Time per step
    <select data-speed aria-label="Time per step">
      <option value="10000">10 seconds</option>
      <option value="6000" selected>6 seconds</option>
      <option value="3000">3 seconds</option>
    </select>
  </label>
</div>
<p class="sim-help">Start with Step to inspect one change at a time, or Play for automatic playback. The caption explains each step; changed cards are outlined.</p>
<p class="sim-playback" data-playback-status role="status">Paused · step 0</p>
